---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Contact the DevNotes Editors | DevNotes"
	description="Contact the DevNotes editors to report a mistake, suggest a topic, pitch a guest article or ask about clearly labelled sponsorships."
>
	<h1>Contact the editors</h1>
	<p class="lead">We read every message and usually reply within a few working days.</p>

	<section class="prose">
		<h2>How we can help</h2>
		<p>
			Spotted an error in a guide or a code sample that no longer works? Tell us the page address and
			what you expected to happen, and we will fix it and credit you in the changelog. Have an idea
			for a topic we have not covered yet? We keep a public list of requested guides and prioritise
			the ones readers ask for most often. Questions about a specific guide are welcome too, and the
			best ones often turn into new FAQ entries or follow-up articles.
		</p>
		<p>
			We also accept a small number of guest articles from practising developers each quarter. Send a
			short outline, a few sentences about yourself and links to two pieces of writing you are proud
			of. For sponsorship enquiries, please read our FAQ first, then email
			<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with details about your product and audience.
		</p>

		<h2>Send a message</h2>
		<!-- Demo form: intentionally not connected to any backend. -->
		<form action="#" method="post" onsubmit="event.preventDefault()">
			<label>Name <input name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
			<label>Email <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
			<label>Page address (optional) <input type="url" name="page" /></label>
			<label>Message <textarea name="message" rows="6" required></textarea></label>
			<button class="btn" type="submit">Send message</button>
		</form>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
